_Af_wrRAnJYO5MoaWA2J31Fz8JgQEZbRvcK7tiwkW-5jDXQ&oe=6A22CFE0"}, {"file_name": "ChallengeMode_Image.png", "id": "1238200904331680", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499301526_1238200907665013_4439728854047711627_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LOKTR3LG2nkQ7kNvwHGU5Ha&_nc_oc=AdqhxaqWK5PlHqtgCSx34FtrzUqq0ayHvG5e0o4f7gG-6UipWNRq1FmR7k_D71xPh1c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_Z7gN7r856On490CybIeesSu7mC29ICx1Rw8QkfTxmfw&oe=6A22FDEB"}, {"file_name": "Cosmetics_Image.png", "id": "1366120307973125", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300977_1366120311306458_2475007633126940757_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gxcM16T8RHoQ7kNvwFl5Zng&_nc_oc=AdoSyanC8bFE9hlMYuWCw06bhn29MEipdUk4nEKuv8YnXgQnZWbNnh2NnV-WW5vg29Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8aKMPioBUZnXKrpvWzkKGrFOJF9aNLg_uhQKjIzRAMxw&oe=6A22F5BB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Punch Bomb", "keywords": ["Punch", "Arcade", "Bomb", "Game", "Challenge"], "long_description": "# Do you like to punch things?!\nPunch Bomb is an intense action arcade game where you punch things designed from the ground up for those who like a challenge!\n\nThis game **IS NOT EASY**\n\nClimb the global leaderboards in 3 punchable game modes!\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n# Classic Mode\n\n\n\nSurvive for as long as you can while punching a variety of bombs away from you before they explode, racking up huge combos, hitting targets, and dodging dangerous laser obstacles!\n{4009259875886708}\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n\n# Blitz Mode\n\nRegular bombs no longer explode in this mode, and targets extend your time. Go ballistic to try to get as high of a score as possible within the time limit!\n{1063827595628759}\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n\n# Challenge Mode\nComplete a fun collection of small challenges that put your speed and accuracy to the test!\n{1207719874395696}\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Unique Cosmetics\nUnlock a variety of unique cosmetics by **PLAYING THE GAME** if you're up for a good challenge! Each with their own unique particle effect!\n\n\n\n\n{1198946195348915}", "short_description": "Do you like to punch things?! Punching bombs away from you before they explode while dodging dangerous laser obstacles and hitting targets! Compete in global leaderboards across 3 punchable game modes!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://punchbomb.com/punchbombTOS.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://punchbomb.com/punchbombTOS.html", "publisher_name": "Chris Folea Makes Things", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.punchbomb.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24451753894412031"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 4, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1263459085875821"}, {